# US English's abbreviation volume, read only while the abbreviation
# dictionary is on, which by default it is not. A word here is matched as
# written and what is said in its place is the expansion. One a line, the
# word, a tab, and what is said; a line starting # is a remark.
#
# The entries straight after this are the body, kept sorted by
# tools/measure/dictgate.py, which takes in the community's later changes.
# Blocks decided by hand come after it, each under a remark saying why.

